{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2021-10-20 16:19:00', 'title': "ADVISORY COMMITTEE ON IMMUNIZATION PRACTICES VOTES TO RECOMMEND ROUTINE USE OF PFIZER'S PREVNAR 20™ (PNEUMOCOCCAL 20-VALENT CONJUGATE VACCINE) IN ADULTS", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE:PFE) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE CENTERS FOR DISEASE CONTROL AND PREVENTION'S (CDC) ADVISORY COMMITTEE ON IMMUNIZATION PRACTICES (ACIP) VOTED TO RECOMMEND PREVNAR 20™ (PNEUMOCOCCAL 20-VALENT CONJUGATE VACCINE) FOR ROUTINE USE TO HELP PROTECT ADULTS AGAINST INVASIVE DISEASE AND PNEUMONIA CAUSED BY THE 20 STREPTOCOCCUS PNEUMONIAE (PNEUMOCOCCUS) SEROTYPES IN THE VACCINE. SPECIFICALLY, THE ACIP VOTED TO RECOMMEND THE FOLLOWING: ADULTS 65 YEARS OF AGE OR OLD"}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2021-10-20 09:13:00', 'title': 'LESS TALK, MORE ACTION: NEW REPORT SPONSORED BY VIIV HEALTHCARE PROVIDES ROADMAP TO ACHIEVE HEALTH EQUITY BY 2040', 'text': 'LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LESS TALK, MORE ACTION: NEW REPORT SPONSORED BY VIIV HEALTHCARE PROVIDES ROADMAP TO ACHIEVE HEALTH EQUITY BY 2040'}